13;selected Conversation with the Sea , about a Palestinian man caught in the crosshairs of Israeli bureaucracy, and Mohanad Yaqubi's Revolutionaries Never Die , revolving around 113 reels of films preserved by Lebanese filmmaker Jocelyne Saab. The final contenders are Asmahan Bkerat's Concrete Land, Hugo Salvaterra's My Semba, Zou Jing Cannes Critics' Week Fipresci-winner A Girl Unknown , Alessandra Sanguinetti's The Illusion of an Everlasting Summer and Alexander Murphy's Tin Castle . Eleven of the films have received the support of the DFI's grantee programs, with Al Remaihi explaining it is at the heart of an interconnected process developed over the institute's 16-year existence. "It just shows that we don't do anything on a singular basis. Everything we do is connected. We have an ecosystem that we built a long time ago, and we've seen the benefits of having something like this," she says. &#8220;A lot of the films in our competition are grantees because it speaks to the type of funding that we do, choices that we make, the people that we work with, and we love to celebrate all of this during the festival with all of that community. It's a great moment for us also to have all of that come together.&#8221; Outside of the competition, there will be gala screening for Paper Tige r, Rami Kodeih's DFI-backed Beirut-set heist thriller Furies, Maiken Baird's Toronto-selected Edward Said: Between Worlds and Bruno Dumont's Red Rocks . blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

